      <title>旅游业高管在椭圆形办公室向特朗普施压 锁定1亿国际游客目标</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E4%B8%9A%E9%AB%98%E7%AE%A1%E5%9C%A8%E6%A4%AD%E5%9C%86%E5%BD%A2%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%A4%E5%90%91%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%96%BD%E5%8E%8B-%E9%94%81%E5%AE%9A1%E4%BA%BF%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87/</link>
